OL,3,AScotland's first AI teacher warns
OL,4,Apupils: Don't trust everything it tells
OL,5,Ayou
OL,6,
OL,7,FSome teenagers are already using
OL,8,Fartificial intelligence to tackle
OL,9,Fhomework, revise for exams and sharpen
OL,10,Fcoursework.
OL,12,FOthers are steering clear of it
OL,13,Fcompletely.
OL,15,FAt one Scottish school, staff have
OL,16,Fdecided that pretending AI doesn't
OL,17,Fexist is not an option.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
