OL,3,AScotland's first AI teacher warns
OL,4,Apupils: Don't trust everything it tells
OL,5,Ayou
OL,6,
OL,7,FMearns Castle High School in East
OL,8,FRenfrewshire is believed to be the
OL,9,Ffirst school in the UK to appoint a
OL,10,Fdedicated principal teacher of AI
OL,11,Fliteracy, creating a role focused
OL,12,Fentirely on helping pupils and staff
OL,13,Funderstand the risks and benefits of
OL,14,Fthe powerful new technology.
